<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Blank-name logo alt fallbacks</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 2rem; background: #fff; color: #111; }
      .row { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
      figure { margin: 0; }
      figcaption { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Blank-name logo alt fallbacks</h1>
    <p>Site name is blank; alts come from the public logo helpers.</p>
    <div class="row">
      <figure>
        <%= recording_studio_site_square_logo(@root) %>
        <figcaption id="square-alt-label">
          alt=<%= RecordingStudioSiteSettings.name_for(@root).presence ||
                   RecordingStudioSiteSettings::Copy.t("helpers.square_logo_alt") %>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <%= recording_studio_site_wide_logo(@root) %>
        <figcaption id="wide-alt-label">
          alt=<%= RecordingStudioSiteSettings.name_for(@root).presence ||
                   RecordingStudioSiteSettings::Copy.t("helpers.wide_logo_alt") %>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
